CLEAN — the acceptance list predates round 1, is durable, and was ratified by a party distinct
from the agent satisfying it. Convergence is claimed only over the BUG/on-list gating half;
the two INCREMENTAL off-list findings are budgeted, not converged, and carry a named human
acceptor with both a revisit trigger and a calendar backstop. Completion is stated as a list
reached, never as an absence of findings.
